.TH sentinel-cache-clear 1  "clear " 
.SH NAME
sentinel\-cache\-clear \- Empty the cache directory and report what was removed: the entry count and the reclaimed bytes. Clearing an empty or missing cache succeeds and reports zero. Refuses rather than guesses when the resolved location looks wrong (empty, the filesystem root, or the current working directory)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsentinel\-cache\-clear\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Empty the cache directory and report what was removed: the entry count and the reclaimed bytes. Clearing an empty or missing cache succeeds and reports zero. Refuses rather than guesses when the resolved location looks wrong (empty, the filesystem root, or the current working directory)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
